    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop Chop</strong>, better get to it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a procedurally generated forest in this incremental game. Cut trees, gather lumber and unlock a growing arsenal of tools and weapons to boost your efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps, uncover rare trees and collect precious metals used for massive, game-changing upgrades. Chopcremental offers lots of progression, upgrades, and discovery to keep you coming back for &quot;just one more tree.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Procedural Maps \u2013 A unique forest with every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tons of Upgrades &amp; Weapons \u2013 From rusty axes to high-tech tree-slicers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Metal Trees \u2013 Find and harvest them for premium resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle &amp; Active Playstyles \u2013 Chop actively or automate and optimize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Progression \u2013 Watch your power grow with every tree you fell</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the ultimate lumber tycoon? And prove once and for all that man is above nature.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop Chop</strong>, better get to it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a procedurally generated forest in this incremental game. Cut trees, gather lumber and unlock a growing arsenal of tools and weapons to boost your efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps, uncover rare trees and collect precious metals used for massive, game-changing upgrades. Chopcremental offers lots of progression, upgrades, and discovery to keep you coming back for &quot;just one more tree.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Procedural Maps \u2013 A unique forest with every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tons of Upgrades &amp; Weapons \u2013 From rusty axes to high-tech tree-slicers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Metal Trees \u2013 Find and harvest them for premium resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle &amp; Active Playstyles \u2013 Chop actively or automate and optimize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Progression \u2013 Watch your power grow with every tree you fell</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the ultimate lumber tycoon? And prove once and for all that man is above nature.</p>",
